sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant Store
    participant Phase1 as Phase 1 (Researcher..Auditor)
    participant Phase2 as Phase 2 (Aggregator)

    Client->>Controller: GET /messages/stream
    Controller->>Phase1: StreamAsync(upstream agents)
    loop per upstream agent
        Phase1-->>Controller: AgentRunUpdate
        Controller-->>Client: SSE content
    end
    Phase1-->>Controller: WorkflowOutputEvent
    Controller->>Store: persist PendingDecision (agent outputs, verdict, tokens)
    Controller-->>Client: SSE approval-required
    Controller-->>Client: stream closes

    Note over Client,Store: turn is durable. Refresh, close tab, walk away all safe. Conflict on new turn attempts.

    alt Approve
        Client->>Controller: GET /decision/stream approve=true
        Controller->>Store: load PendingDecision
        Controller->>Phase2: StreamAsync Aggregator only, input = history + user msg + upstream outputs
        Phase2-->>Controller: AgentRunUpdate
        Controller-->>Client: SSE content
        Phase2-->>Controller: WorkflowOutputEvent
        Controller->>Store: commit turn, clear PendingDecision, update LatestPlan
        Controller-->>Client: SSE plan-final, complete
    else Reject + feedback + replan
        Client->>Controller: GET /decision/stream approve=false, replan=true, feedback=...
        Controller->>Store: clear PendingDecision
        Controller->>Controller: synthesize Previous draft rejected. Feedback... Please revise.

        Note over Controller: chain into ContinueConversationStreamingAsync. Router picks Replan, full subset runs.
    
    else Reject or cancel
        Client->>Controller: GET /decision/stream approve=false, or DELETE /pending
        Controller->>Store: clear PendingDecision, commit chat-style reply. LatestPlan unchanged.
        Controller-->>Client: SSE clarified, complete
    end
